{"id":"6e56db0129607b23","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-rosser-incompleteness.md","title":"Rosser's Incompleteness Theorem","display":"thm-rosser-incompleteness — Rosser's Incompleteness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-rosser-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-rosser-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-rosser-incompleteness — Rosser's Incompleteness Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-rosser-sentence]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 VI 章 pp. 79–82；第 VIII 章 p. 104 练习 6（PDF 96–99、121）","source_status":"原书定理的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-rosser-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-rosser-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rosser-incompleteness — Rosser's Incompleteness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9252d4105cc5f189\" href=\"?note=9252d4105cc5f189\" title=\"92-df-rosser-sentence\">92-df-rosser-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VI 章 pp. 79–82；第 VIII 章 p. 104 练习 6（PDF 96–99、121）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书定理的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (effectivity and arithmetic-strength conditions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\\)</span> (Rosser-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9252d4105cc5f189\" href=\"?note=9252d4105cc5f189\" title=\"92-df-rosser-sentence\">92-df-rosser-sentence</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(G\\nvdash R\\land G\\nvdash\\neg R\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(G\\nvdash R\\land G\\nvdash\\neg R\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> : Rosser句子 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9252d4105cc5f189\" href=\"?note=9252d4105cc5f189\" title=\"92-df-rosser-sentence\">92-df-rosser-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li>Rosser定理只需普通一致性（无需<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性）</li>\n<li>“只需普通一致性”是相对于仍保留有效可公理化、正确证明算术化与足够算术强度而言，并不删除这些结构前提</li>\n<li>通过证明码次序比较实现</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>断言&quot;如果我有证明码 p，则我的否定有一个不大于 p 的证明码&quot;</li>\n<li>这是Gödel原始证明的改进</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>证明针对修订后的指定 Rosser 公式。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 有证明码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，一致性排除所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg R\">\\(\\neg R\\)</span> 证明，有限地验证每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\le p\">\\(q\\le p\\)</span> 的负证明实例，再结合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 固定点得到矛盾。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg R\">\\(\\neg R\\)</span> 有证明码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>，一致性排除所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 证明；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p&lt;q\">\\(p&lt;q\\)</span> 的情形用有限负实例，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\le p\">\\(q\\le p\\)</span> 的情形用正否定证明实例，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 证明每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 都满足 Rosser 条件，推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，再矛盾。比较的是码次序，不是未定义的字符长度。不能把任选的标准模型等价公式代入这个论证。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VI 章 pp. 79–82；第 VIII 章 p. 104 练习 6（PDF 96–99、121）。</p>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"9252d4105cc5f189","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-rosser-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (consistency, see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"9252d4105cc5f189","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)$ (Rosser-sentence predicate, see [[92-df-rosser-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"9252d4105cc5f189","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$R$ : Rosser句子 (see [[92-df-rosser-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q","status":"resolved","id":"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"算术强度核对：$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ 表示每条 $Q$ 公理在 $G$ 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见[[92-lem-local-pa-proves-q]]；若继续要求 $Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 $G$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(G\\nvdash R\\land G\\nvdash\\neg R\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg R","display":false},{"tex":"q\\le p","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg R","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"p<q","display":false},{"tex":"q\\le p","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":2635,"backlinks":[{"id":"c1547d2395ecc99c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-rosser-sentence]]与[[92-thm-rosser-incompleteness]]给出本地证明码构造与双向不可证性。证明序比较的是自然数证明码，不是字符串长度。"},{"id":"3402731b38b2c005","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-300","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-rosser-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["e0eabee5d77258a7","9252d4105cc5f189","c7befd96bd551ade","360e00ddf38f0f16","468d35690d25ee42","975b3aa9a1e08797","0a1ba58f66cc8d4e"]}